WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:02.980
<b>Welcome!</b>

00:03.350 --> 00:06.110
<b>How about some piping-hot fried chicken?</b>

00:06.110 --> 00:08.730
<b>YUMMY JELLY</b>

00:06.110 --> 00:08.730
<b>SUGAR-FREE TEA</b>

00:06.650 --> 00:08.730
<b>Please tap your phone there.</b>

00:10.230 --> 00:12.740
<b>IF YOU PURCHASE OVER 700 YEN,
YOU CAN DRAW ONE!!</b>

00:11.240 --> 00:15.360
<b>All right, sir! Here's your
lottery ticket for our campaign!</b>

00:15.950 --> 00:17.320
<b>Draw one, please.</b>

00:19.580 --> 00:20.490
<b>By any chance...</b>

00:20.490 --> 00:27.130
<b>LAST NIGHT
CONVERSATION IN FOS</b>

00:20.910 --> 00:23.120
<b><i>You'll go to a convenience store
tomorrow, right?</i></b>

00:22.580 --> 00:25.420
<b>did you pester me so hard
just to get me to do this?</b>

00:23.120 --> 00:25.580
<b>Then drop by mine!
See, we have a fun event going on!</b>

00:25.580 --> 00:26.920
<b>Is your interest piqued?</b>

00:25.750 --> 00:28.420
<b>Hey, why not?
It's on your way home, anyway, right?</b>

00:27.250 --> 00:32.630
<b>THEY'RE DOING THIS
NEAR MY PLACE, TOO</b>

00:27.250 --> 00:32.630
<b>YOU REALLY
DON'T EAT HEALTHY</b>

00:28.420 --> 00:31.130
<b>And you buy your dinner here every day,
don't you?</b>

00:31.130 --> 00:32.590
<b>Right. I guess so.</b>

00:32.970 --> 00:35.930
<b>We haven't seen each other
since the festival, huh? How's Runa doing?</b>

00:36.340 --> 00:38.890
<b>Yeah, she seems to be studying hard.</b>

00:39.560 --> 00:40.640
<b>Is that right?</b>

00:40.760 --> 00:42.390
<b>HE WON SOME CUP RAMEN</b>

00:41.220 --> 00:44.520
<b>She calls me once in a while,
but we hardly ever get to see each other.</b>

00:45.940 --> 00:48.020
<b>Is that a friend of yours, Akane?</b>

00:45.940 --> 00:50.900
<b>AKANE'S CO-WORKER,
MS. SHINOHARA (HOUSEWIFE)</b>

00:48.520 --> 00:49.610
<b>Ms. Shinohara!</b>

00:49.610 --> 00:51.360
<b>What a good-looking kid!</b>

00:51.360 --> 00:54.570
<b>He sure is! We met playing the same game!</b>

00:54.570 --> 00:58.120
<b>He has such a gorgeous face.
He looks like an actor!</b>

00:58.120 --> 00:59.370
<b>My heart's pounding!</b>

01:00.200 --> 01:01.490
<b>Okay, I'll be heading—</b>

01:01.490 --> 01:03.870
<b>My shift will be over soon,
so wait for me!</b>

01:03.870 --> 01:05.040
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

02:37.880 --> 02:39.880
<b>Look at him waiting so faithfully.</b>

02:40.430 --> 02:41.970
<b>Is he your boyfriend, by any chance?</b>

02:41.970 --> 02:46.640
<b>No, no! He seems to have a hard time
dealing with women, so it's not like that.</b>

02:46.640 --> 02:48.020
<b>Oh, well, what a shame.</b>

02:48.020 --> 02:50.770
<b>FUFU</b>

02:48.640 --> 02:51.020
<b>But you like him, don't you, Akane?</b>

02:51.020 --> 02:51.850
<b>Huh?</b>

02:51.850 --> 02:54.270
<b>You were so determined
to keep him from leaving!</b>

02:55.110 --> 02:58.280
<b>Uh... I don't know about that.</b>

02:57.900 --> 03:01.780
<b>FUN!</b>

02:58.280 --> 03:01.240
<b>Ah! Spoken like a true maiden!</b>

03:02.320 --> 03:04.910
<b><i>It's true that,
compared to when we first met,</i></b>

03:04.120 --> 03:09.620
<b>I'M NOT INTERESTED</b>

03:04.910 --> 03:09.620
<b><i>Yamada seems to have
really opened up to me.</i></b>

03:06.080 --> 03:09.290
<b>WHAT A PAIN
I WANT TO GO HOME</b>

03:09.290 --> 03:10.540
<b>KINOSHITA</b>

03:11.040 --> 03:14.540
<b><i>I can see that he's
really a very sweet kid.</i></b>

03:16.460 --> 03:17.380
<b>Good job.</b>

03:17.880 --> 03:19.300
<b><i>The thought does cross my mind.</i></b>

03:19.760 --> 03:20.670
<b>Thanks for waiting!</b>

03:22.220 --> 03:27.560
<b><i>Even if we're only linked by a game,
I'm happy that we're able to get closer.</i></b>

03:29.560 --> 03:33.980
<b><i>But the same goes for Eita and Runa,
doesn't it?</i></b>

03:30.560 --> 03:35.060
<b>The Guild is Facing a Crisis!!</b>

03:36.690 --> 03:39.320
<b>Hey, I didn't ask you here
for the lottery.</b>

03:39.780 --> 03:44.740
<b>Actually, I made you a meal to thank you,
and I wanted to give it to you.</b>

03:45.240 --> 03:46.160
<b>To thank me?</b>

03:46.160 --> 03:47.160
<b>For my computer.</b>

03:47.580 --> 03:50.200
<b>Since I couldn't really do much for you
during the festival.</b>

03:50.870 --> 03:52.710
<b>It's not really a big deal, you know.</b>

03:53.000 --> 03:56.210
<b>Now that my penny-pinching days
are finally over...</b>

03:56.710 --> 03:58.420
<b>there's a pretty lavish feast in there!</b>

04:01.340 --> 04:03.090
<b><i>I don't know why...</i></b>

04:04.090 --> 04:07.050
<b><i>but I feel like I shouldn't see him...</i></b>

04:07.560 --> 04:09.100
<b><i>in a romantic light.</i></b>

04:13.020 --> 04:14.480
<b>Achoo!</b>

04:14.980 --> 04:17.820
<b>Uh-oh, I sneezed in front of someone
about to take entrance exams.</b>

04:18.230 --> 04:19.320
<b>Do you have a cold?</b>

04:19.320 --> 04:21.110
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

04:21.320 --> 04:22.860
<b>Did I have a mask in here?</b>

04:35.370 --> 04:36.210
<b>Did you find one?</b>

04:37.130 --> 04:37.960
<b>Found it.</b>

04:57.400 --> 04:59.230
<b>I hope that it doesn't get worse.</b>

04:59.770 --> 05:00.610
<b>Your cold.</b>

05:04.820 --> 05:05.650
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:07.410 --> 05:08.370
<b>Thanks.</b>

05:16.080 --> 05:21.090
<b>FARAWAY GAZE...</b>

05:16.330 --> 05:21.090
<b>A guy who's unwittingly kind,
don't you think that's terrifying?</b>

05:23.760 --> 05:24.670
<b>Keep going.</b>

05:25.050 --> 05:26.510
<b>Let down your guard,</b>

05:26.510 --> 05:29.350
<b>and you're like,
"Wait, is he into me?"</b>

05:29.350 --> 05:32.930
<b>But it's a delusion, and that's
not the guy's intention at all.</b>

05:32.930 --> 05:37.230
<b>He's just displaying kindness.
It's a terrifying trap.</b>

05:38.150 --> 05:40.310
<b>Let me confirm one thing.</b>

05:40.860 --> 05:43.280
<b>How can you be so sure
that it's not his intention?</b>

05:43.480 --> 05:49.950
<b>STUDYING NAIL ART</b>

05:43.780 --> 05:46.110
<b>Also, can I try something
a little flashy on you?</b>

05:46.110 --> 05:47.450
<b>The theme is "Night Butterfly."</b>

05:47.450 --> 05:48.570
<b>What? Please don't.</b>

05:48.570 --> 05:49.950
<b>I'll get into trouble at work.</b>

05:50.990 --> 05:54.660
<b>You're not naming any names,
but you're talking about Yamada, right?</b>

05:54.080 --> 05:56.580
<b>OHHH</b>

05:55.160 --> 05:56.000
<b>Yup.</b>

05:56.000 --> 05:58.830
<b>But you were so thrilled
that he said you were out of his league!</b>

05:58.830 --> 06:01.130
<b>I don't even think he meant much by that.</b>

06:01.130 --> 06:01.960
<b>Huh?</b>

06:02.290 --> 06:04.960
<b>That's what makes it so terrifying.</b>

06:06.590 --> 06:09.180
<b>If a hot, younger guy
ever said that to me,</b>

06:09.180 --> 06:11.510
<b>even if he wasn't thinking straight,</b>

06:11.510 --> 06:14.100
<b>I wouldn't waste any time making a move.</b>

06:13.470 --> 06:18.850
<b>NIGHT BUTTERFLY</b>

06:14.100 --> 06:16.730
<b>I have no idea
why you're hemming and hawing.</b>

06:14.720 --> 06:18.850
<b>WELL?</b>

06:15.100 --> 06:18.850
<b>NO</b>

06:16.730 --> 06:18.850
<b>I'm not hemming and hawing.</b>

06:19.020 --> 06:23.110
<b>Really? It looks to me like the most
hemming and hawing you've ever done.</b>

06:23.900 --> 06:26.610
<b>I see you having a blast
talking about Yamada</b>

06:26.610 --> 06:28.740
<b>and trying to figure him out...</b>

06:29.610 --> 06:33.200
<b>but you haven't said a word about
what you want to do, Akane.</b>

06:34.990 --> 06:39.460
<b>If you don't tell me that,
I can't possibly make any comments.</b>

06:42.040 --> 06:43.540
<b>You're absolutely right.</b>

06:44.250 --> 06:45.840
<b>- Night Butterfly?
- That, I decline!</b>

06:45.960 --> 06:50.340
<b>RUNA SASAKI</b>

06:48.220 --> 06:49.260
<b>It's Runa.</b>

06:49.260 --> 06:51.510
<b>Oh, that girl? I remember her.</b>

06:51.510 --> 06:53.010
<b>The middle-school Goth girl.</b>

06:53.010 --> 06:53.850
<b>That's right.</b>

06:54.260 --> 06:55.100
<b>Hello?</b>

06:55.100 --> 06:57.220
<b><i>Akane! Can we meet up now?</i></b>

06:57.220 --> 06:59.480
<b>The guild is facing a crisis!</b>

06:59.890 --> 07:00.730
<b>Huh?</b>

07:08.940 --> 07:10.490
<b>Runa!</b>

07:11.070 --> 07:12.320
<b>Thanks for waiting!</b>

07:13.780 --> 07:16.790
<b>Are you sure it's okay
for you to be out at this hour?</b>

07:16.790 --> 07:18.540
<b>It's starting to get dark.</b>

07:18.540 --> 07:20.660
<b>I came by taxi, so it's all good.</b>

07:20.660 --> 07:22.670
<b>I'm also going home by taxi.</b>

07:22.790 --> 07:24.670
<b>Then I guess
there's nothing to worry about!</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:27.090
<b>Hey, listen. This afternoon,
I was with Yamada, and—</b>

07:27.090 --> 07:29.090
<b>Never mind that! Did you read my text?</b>

07:29.590 --> 07:30.590
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

07:30.930 --> 07:33.760
<b>I read it.
We're getting a new guild member.</b>

07:34.140 --> 07:37.720
<b>Yet another woman that I don't know
just joined our guild.</b>

07:38.770 --> 07:42.650
<b>It's unbelievable! We agreed
to keep it in the family when we started!</b>

07:42.650 --> 07:44.440
<b>Oh, I do like you now, Akane,</b>

07:44.440 --> 07:46.230
<b><i>Talk about cliquish.</i></b>

07:44.440 --> 07:46.770
<b>but at this rate,
when I'm done with my exams,</b>

07:46.770 --> 07:48.280
<b>it'll be a totally different guild!</b>

07:48.280 --> 07:49.860
<b>Not only that, but it's a woman!</b>

07:49.860 --> 07:53.360
<b>When I can't deal with women!
Women always hate me!</b>

07:51.070 --> 07:55.160
<b>BECAUSE I'M CUTE!?</b>

07:53.360 --> 07:55.160
<b>Well, I'm looking forward to it, you know.</b>

07:55.160 --> 08:00.540
<b>GRIND GRIND</b>

07:55.700 --> 07:58.540
<b>I hope it's a girl
who's new to online games.</b>

07:58.540 --> 08:00.660
<b>Hey, I bought some hot chocolate.
Want some?</b>

07:58.540 --> 08:01.540
<b>IT'S A LIMITED EDITION
FOR WINTER</b>

08:00.660 --> 08:01.540
<b>Too nonchalant!</b>

08:01.540 --> 08:06.540
<b>CONFIDENTIAL
SUPER SECRET
ABSOLUTELY CANNOT PEEK</b>

08:01.910 --> 08:03.370
<b>So anyway...</b>

08:03.370 --> 08:05.710
<b>I drew up a plan
to drive her out immediately.</b>

08:05.710 --> 08:06.540
<b>Hey!</b>

08:07.630 --> 08:12.090
<b>New players have anxieties,
so it's on us to welcome them, okay?</b>

08:13.630 --> 08:14.680
<b>COCOA</b>

08:14.970 --> 08:17.350
<b>And you know what,
once you get to really know her,</b>

08:17.350 --> 08:18.760
<b>you might end up as friends.</b>

08:19.270 --> 08:20.930
<b>Just like you and me.</b>

08:30.360 --> 08:32.990
<b>The thought that you
might get to be friends</b>

08:32.990 --> 08:35.410
<b>with someone you normally wouldn't meet...</b>

08:35.410 --> 08:36.870
<b>isn't it kind of exciting?</b>

08:38.490 --> 08:39.660
<b>That's what I don't like!</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:42.410
<b>I know that you're going
to get close to her right away!</b>

08:42.620 --> 08:46.250
<b>Then you're going to start hanging out
with her all the time, not me, right?</b>

08:46.250 --> 08:48.960
<b>That's not true.
I haven't even talked to her yet.</b>

08:48.960 --> 08:50.800
<b>I just know that's what's going to happen!</b>

08:50.170 --> 08:53.550
<b>UH...</b>

08:50.800 --> 08:53.550
<b>The three of us can all be friends,
can't we?</b>

08:53.550 --> 08:56.300
<b>I don't like odd numbers!
One of us will be left out!</b>

08:57.260 --> 08:59.350
<b>Let's all get along together, okay?</b>

09:00.390 --> 09:01.520
<b>Okay?</b>

09:07.350 --> 09:10.360
<b>JUST RIDE THIS OUT WITH COCOA...</b>

09:07.810 --> 09:10.190
<b><i>It's like I have a jealous girlfriend now.</i></b>

09:11.110 --> 09:13.320
<b>Well, I knew all along...</b>

09:13.990 --> 09:15.650
<b>that you'd say something like that.</b>

09:18.160 --> 09:22.620
<b>And my brother's like,
"Yamada's introducing us to this girl,</b>

09:22.620 --> 09:25.160
<b>so you'd better
give her a proper welcome."</b>

09:25.960 --> 09:26.920
<b>It was Yamada?</b>

09:25.960 --> 09:32.590
<b>THANK YOU FOR THE COCOA</b>

09:26.920 --> 09:28.540
<b>I hear it's a girl in his class.</b>

09:29.040 --> 09:32.590
<b>She usually plays FPS games,</b>

09:32.760 --> 09:35.300
<b>but she wants to take a break
and play an MMO.</b>

09:35.840 --> 09:39.970
<b>They seem to be pretty close, but when
I called and asked him about her...</b>

09:39.970 --> 09:41.140
<b><i>Tell me!</i></b>

09:41.140 --> 09:41.970
<b><i>She's normal.</i></b>

09:42.720 --> 09:45.600
<b>...Yamada wouldn't tell me much.</b>

09:46.140 --> 09:51.070
<b>And he said if I was mean to her
like when you joined, he'd really get mad.</b>

09:50.360 --> 09:54.110
<b>I HAVEN'T EVEN DONE ANYTHING YET...</b>

09:51.900 --> 09:54.110
<b><i>A girl that he's friends with?</i></b>

09:54.820 --> 09:58.410
<b>Kind of unexpected, don't you think?
For Yamada to bring in a girl?</b>

09:58.910 --> 10:01.120
<b>Huh? Yeah, I guess so.</b>

10:01.620 --> 10:04.370
<b>Oh! Never mind that! I have a great idea!</b>

10:04.620 --> 10:05.790
<b>Give me your phone!</b>

10:06.880 --> 10:08.370
<b>ADD A PHOTO</b>

10:07.460 --> 10:08.370
<b>YAMADA</b>

10:09.290 --> 10:10.420
<b>What are you doing?</b>

10:10.420 --> 10:12.550
<b>I'm saving Yamada's number.</b>

10:12.550 --> 10:14.130
<b>You call him, Akane!</b>

10:14.710 --> 10:19.390
<b>He was wary of me, so Runa didn't
get anywhere, but I bet he'd tell you!</b>

10:19.930 --> 10:23.220
<b>If Runa just knew what kind of girl
she is, I could rest easy!</b>

10:22.140 --> 10:23.930
<b>AKITO YAMADA</b>

10:25.180 --> 10:25.640
<b>4F KAWAI CRAM SCHOOL
3F KAWAI CRAM SCHOOL</b>

10:26.060 --> 10:29.140
<b>I hear that they
started dating after that!</b>

10:29.140 --> 10:30.010
<b>For real?</b>

10:30.010 --> 10:32.650
<b>But didn't they say
they weren't each other's type?</b>

10:32.650 --> 10:35.150
<b>Even still,
we're talking about a boy and a girl, so—</b>

10:35.900 --> 10:37.820
<b>Even if you think there's no way,</b>

10:37.820 --> 10:40.990
<b>they can end up together
thanks to something trivial.</b>

10:45.950 --> 10:50.120
<b>Can people fall in love
thanks to something trivial?</b>

10:51.170 --> 10:52.960
<b>Hello, Prez!</b>

10:52.960 --> 10:55.250
<b>Good evening, Okamoto and Yamada.</b>

10:55.750 --> 10:57.720
<b>- Hi.
- Hey, Prez,</b>

10:57.720 --> 11:00.840
<b>that's pretty funny,
walking in here, muttering to yourself.</b>

11:00.840 --> 11:03.300
<b>What? I was asking you two a question.</b>

11:03.050 --> 11:07.180
<b>WELL, SORRY ABOUT THAT</b>

11:03.930 --> 11:07.180
<b>Lovers, huh? Well, the thing is...</b>

11:07.180 --> 11:11.270
<b>YEARS WITHOUT A GIRLFRIEND = WHOLE LIFE
HOBBY = VIDEO GAMES</b>

11:07.350 --> 11:10.060
<b>I'm not sure you're asking
the right people here.</b>

11:10.060 --> 11:11.270
<b>Well, you do have a point.</b>

11:11.650 --> 11:15.190
<b>Oh, and, Yamada,
thanks for letting me into your guild...</b>

11:15.520 --> 11:17.280
<b>talking to the guild master for me.</b>

11:17.610 --> 11:18.440
<b>Sure.</b>

11:18.940 --> 11:20.110
<b>What's this about?</b>

11:20.110 --> 11:21.030
<b>About games.</b>

11:21.530 --> 11:22.410
<b>Oh, FOS?</b>

11:22.910 --> 11:24.830
<b>I just started playing it,</b>

11:24.830 --> 11:27.660
<b>and I heard that it's better
to be in one of the stronger guilds.</b>

11:28.160 --> 11:30.080
<b>So I asked Yamada to let me join his.</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:30.960
<b>CAN I EAT
THIS BURGER?</b>

11:30.500 --> 11:32.580
<b>BUT CLASS IS
ABOUT TO START</b>

11:30.580 --> 11:32.580
<b>Well, you are a secret gamer, right, Prez?</b>

11:32.880 --> 11:34.920
<b>I wouldn't say that I'm hiding it.</b>

11:34.920 --> 11:37.840
<b>But it's not like I can talk about it
with the other girls.</b>

11:37.840 --> 11:39.300
<b>It's all mostly girl talk, anyway.</b>

11:40.420 --> 11:42.760
<b>Prez! You're into girl talk?</b>

11:43.640 --> 11:44.510
<b>Not really.</b>

11:46.890 --> 11:50.270
<b>So you've sacrificed your youth
to gaming, too, huh?</b>

11:59.990 --> 12:01.450
<b>You're not picking up?</b>

12:00.440 --> 12:02.950
<b>IT'S SUPER
VIBRATING...</b>

12:01.450 --> 12:02.950
<b>It's an unknown number.</b>

12:02.950 --> 12:06.080
<b>INCOMING CALL</b>

12:03.450 --> 12:05.370
<b>And class is about to start.</b>

12:06.080 --> 12:08.080
<b>TELEPHONE
1 MISSED CALL</b>

12:06.620 --> 12:07.540
<b>Hey, it stopped.</b>

12:08.490 --> 12:12.040
<b>You seem to get a lot of those calls,
huh, Yamada?</b>

12:12.040 --> 12:15.210
<b>And when you pick up, it's some girl
you don't know confessing her love!</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:15.210
<b>THINGS LIKE THAT DON'T HAPPEN</b>

12:16.000 --> 12:17.710
<b>If you wanted to, you could get any—</b>

12:17.710 --> 12:18.710
<b>Yamada...</b>

12:20.090 --> 12:22.590
<b>isn't into romance, isn't that right?</b>

12:22.720 --> 12:24.130
<b>SCARED ME,
SUCH A LOUD VOICE</b>

12:24.640 --> 12:26.760
<b>Well, I guess not.</b>

12:33.440 --> 12:34.520
<b>I thought so.</b>

12:37.520 --> 12:38.980
<b>Man, I'm starving!</b>

12:39.400 --> 12:40.900
<b>Can't take it anymore. I'll die!</b>

12:41.400 --> 12:43.610
<b>Didn't you just have a hamburger?</b>

12:43.610 --> 12:45.570
<b>I'd kill for a burger now.</b>

12:45.570 --> 12:46.410
<b>Another one?</b>

12:46.660 --> 12:49.080
<b>Right, this time,
I'm gonna get some fries, too!</b>

12:51.540 --> 12:53.500
<b>Huh? Hey, are you listening?</b>

12:53.500 --> 12:54.420
<b>My phone.</b>

12:54.420 --> 12:56.290
<b>Huh? The same person who called before?</b>

12:57.080 --> 13:00.460
<b>If it's a girl with a sweet voice,
give me the phone, okay?</b>

13:01.300 --> 13:02.590
<b>Hey, you blowing me off?</b>

13:06.050 --> 13:07.050
<b>AKITO YAMADA
INCOMING CALL</b>

13:07.390 --> 13:08.800
<b>Coming!</b>

13:11.850 --> 13:12.680
<b><i>Yes?</i></b>

13:12.680 --> 13:14.390
<b>Uh, sorry. You just called me.</b>

13:14.390 --> 13:15.440
<b><i>Yamada?</i></b>

13:16.560 --> 13:18.230
<b>It's me, Akane!</b>

13:19.520 --> 13:20.480
<b>Akane?</b>

13:20.650 --> 13:21.730
<b>I knew it was a woman.</b>

13:22.230 --> 13:24.240
<b>Wait, did I give you my—</b>

13:24.240 --> 13:26.860
<b>I know, I know.
Sorry I took the liberty of calling!</b>

13:27.360 --> 13:30.410
<b>The thing is,
I was with Runa this evening—</b>

13:30.410 --> 13:31.950
<b>A-Achoo!</b>

13:32.450 --> 13:33.660
<b>Are you all right?</b>

13:33.660 --> 13:37.500
<b><i>Yeah, sure. Anyway,
I wanted to ask you something,</i></b>

13:37.500 --> 13:40.420
<b><i>but I have to go to work right now.</i></b>

13:40.460 --> 13:42.460
<b>WELCOME!</b>

13:40.670 --> 13:42.460
<b>What? But you worked this afternoon.</b>

13:42.710 --> 13:46.300
<b>Well, my boss can't reach
the person on the night shift...</b>

13:46.800 --> 13:49.090
<b>so I got called in on short notice.</b>

13:49.090 --> 13:51.100
<b><i>Can't someone switch with you?</i></b>

13:51.100 --> 13:52.470
<b>No one seems to be available.</b>

13:53.680 --> 13:56.980
<b><i>Since I live nearby,
I guess I'm fair game!</i></b>

13:56.980 --> 13:57.980
<b>Is that right?</b>

13:59.650 --> 14:01.150
<b>Hey, Yamada.</b>

14:01.150 --> 14:02.230
<b><i>Yes?</i></b>

14:03.070 --> 14:05.110
<b><i>Your voice is
a little lower over the phone.</i></b>

14:05.990 --> 14:06.900
<b>Never mind!</b>

14:08.110 --> 14:10.950
<b>FULL MOON BURGER</b>

14:08.450 --> 14:10.950
<b>OKAMOTO'S OFF SHOPPING</b>

14:11.580 --> 14:14.450
<b>That call you just got, was it
the person who came to the festival?</b>

14:15.200 --> 14:20.080
<b>AMAZING</b>

14:15.370 --> 14:16.710
<b>How could you tell?</b>

14:17.290 --> 14:19.580
<b>Because I heard you call her name.</b>

14:20.540 --> 14:23.090
<b>We're in the same guild in FOS,</b>

14:23.090 --> 14:26.130
<b>so you'll be hanging out with her, too,
sooner or later.</b>

14:26.130 --> 14:27.170
<b>I see.</b>

14:28.430 --> 14:31.050
<b>You seem pretty close
in private as well.</b>

14:31.050 --> 14:32.050
<b>I guess so.</b>

14:32.680 --> 14:35.270
<b>The guild master
was an upperclassman back home.</b>

14:36.230 --> 14:37.100
<b><i>I can't...</i></b>

14:37.890 --> 14:39.230
<b><i>remember her face.</i></b>

14:41.400 --> 14:42.360
<b>What's she like?</b>

14:43.270 --> 14:45.400
<b>Ei—You mean the master?</b>

14:45.400 --> 14:47.570
<b>No, I mean the person named Akane.</b>

14:48.740 --> 14:50.280
<b>Akane is...</b>

14:53.370 --> 14:55.240
<b><i>This is my new boyfriend!</i></b>

14:54.620 --> 14:56.870
<b><i>Don't tell me it was a one-night stand?!</i></b>

14:55.740 --> 14:56.870
<b><i>Yamara!</i></b>

14:56.870 --> 14:59.710
<b>ALWAYS MAKING THOSE WEIRD FACES</b>

15:02.290 --> 15:03.130
<b><i>Yamada!</i></b>

15:08.800 --> 15:10.890
<b>I really couldn't say.</b>

15:14.810 --> 15:15.640
<b>Could it be...</b>

15:18.140 --> 15:18.980
<b>that you like her?</b>

15:27.110 --> 15:30.910
<b>Akane! Sorry, I really owe you one!</b>

15:31.320 --> 15:33.450
<b>I can't get in touch
with the night-shift worker,</b>

15:33.450 --> 15:35.580
<b>and I can't handle it on my own.</b>

15:35.580 --> 15:39.540
<b>Isn't it high time
you fired the habitual shirker?</b>

15:39.540 --> 15:47.550
<b>I HAVE A HUGE GRUDGE</b>

15:39.870 --> 15:41.670
<b>W-Well, you're right, I guess!</b>

15:41.670 --> 15:45.040
<b>But he's not all bad, you know!
Loves guitars—</b>

15:45.040 --> 15:47.550
<b>Hey, to make it up to you,
I'll treat you to dinner!</b>

15:47.760 --> 15:49.510
<b>What do you say to tomorrow night?</b>

15:49.510 --> 15:51.180
<b>- I know a great—
- Not going!</b>

15:50.550 --> 15:52.050
<b>I'LL BE HAVING DINNER AT HOME</b>

15:51.180 --> 15:52.050
<b>Oh...</b>

15:55.970 --> 15:59.770
<b><i>I wanted to call it a night,
because I'm coming down with a cold.</i></b>

16:08.730 --> 16:09.990
<b>CALL LOG
AKITO YAMADA
MOMO
MOMO
MOMO</b>

16:11.400 --> 16:13.990
<b><i>Seems strange to have Yamada's name
in my call history!</i></b>

16:15.410 --> 16:16.950
<b>All right, let's get to work!</b>

16:29.880 --> 16:33.470
<b><i>You haven't said a word
about what you want to do, Akane.</i></b>

16:34.050 --> 16:35.930
<b>- Akane!
- Oh!</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:37.220
<b>Coming!</b>

16:37.220 --> 16:38.680
<b>Not good, not good!</b>

16:46.480 --> 16:49.360
<b>DRAGON HELM
DRAGON MAIL
DRAGON CUIRASS
DRAGON GREAVES
DRAGON BOOTS</b>

16:47.440 --> 16:49.360
<b>LOG IN TO ARIA SERVER 5?
YES     NO</b>

16:54.070 --> 16:56.740
<b>PLAYER RURIHIME HAS INVITED YOU
TO JOIN THE CHOCOLATE RABBIT GUILD.
WILL YOU JOIN?
YES NO</b>

17:09.920 --> 17:13.720
<b>TO YOU, WHO HAS LOST LOVE
MEDICINE FOR A BROKEN HEART</b>

17:11.800 --> 17:13.720
<b><i>Not that I still have feelings for him...</i></b>

17:14.880 --> 17:16.680
<b>But now, maybe just a little...</b>

17:18.350 --> 17:19.720
<b><i>Sorry, Akane.</i></b>

17:22.640 --> 17:24.890
<b><i>I do have some regrets.</i></b>

17:28.230 --> 17:30.650
<b>AKANE</b>

17:29.320 --> 17:30.650
<b>Hey! It's Akane!</b>

17:32.860 --> 17:34.990
<b>I'M SO TIRED</b>

17:33.110 --> 17:34.150
<b>Can I take this?</b>

17:34.150 --> 17:34.990
<b>Go ahead.</b>

17:36.360 --> 17:39.990
<b>So what's going on, Akane?
I'm in a tutoring session!</b>

17:41.330 --> 17:42.500
<b><i>Ru... na.</i></b>

17:42.500 --> 17:44.870
<b>LIKE A ZOMBIE</b>

17:42.500 --> 17:44.870
<b>What's wrong with your voice? Sounds bad!</b>

17:45.210 --> 17:48.670
<b>A cold?
Then you can't play with me tonight?</b>

17:49.500 --> 17:51.050
<b>I see.</b>

17:51.750 --> 17:54.760
<b>No, no, it's all right.
It can't be helped, right?</b>

17:55.590 --> 17:57.130
<b>Take care of yourself.</b>

18:00.260 --> 18:02.260
<b>AND WE HAD PROMISED
TO PLAY FOS TOGETHER
AT NIGHT...</b>

18:00.260 --> 18:02.260
<b>Akane says she has a cold.</b>

18:02.890 --> 18:04.890
<b>She sounded like she was dying.</b>

18:04.890 --> 18:06.560
<b>I wonder if she's okay?</b>

18:06.890 --> 18:09.270
<b>I hope it's not too serious.</b>

18:10.820 --> 18:14.820
<b>COLD COMPRESS
COLD PACK</b>

18:37.630 --> 18:39.470
<b><i>My throat hurts so much.</i></b>

18:39.470 --> 18:41.350
<b><i>I can't drink any water.</i></b>

18:42.140 --> 18:43.930
<b><i>I've got to take my medicine.</i></b>

18:44.680 --> 18:47.690
<b>QUITE SERIOUSLY ILL</b>

18:45.680 --> 18:48.690
<b><i>Actually, first I need to eat something.</i></b>

18:49.400 --> 18:51.770
<b><i>I haven't eaten since yesterday.</i></b>

18:55.570 --> 18:57.950
<b><i>Oh... let me take a little break.</i></b>

18:57.950 --> 19:01.200
<b>A SHORT BREAK</b>

18:59.740 --> 19:01.200
<b><i>I'm exhausted.</i></b>

19:01.780 --> 19:06.870
<b><i>Not only that, but somehow
I picked the perfect time... to be...</i></b>

19:03.580 --> 19:05.370
<b>KOYANAGI CLINIC
CLOSED SAT./SUN.</b>

19:06.450 --> 19:09.580
<b>MOMO</b>

19:06.870 --> 19:09.580
<b><i>The person you called cannot be reached...</i></b>

19:08.500 --> 19:09.580
<b><i>unlucky in every way.</i></b>

19:10.370 --> 19:11.290
<b><i>But...</i></b>

19:11.790 --> 19:15.420
<b><i>no one's going to help me,
even if I weep and wail.</i></b>

19:16.380 --> 19:19.930
<b><i>So unless I take action,
only death awaits.</i></b>

19:21.640 --> 19:23.140
<b><i>First, I've got to eat.</i></b>

19:23.640 --> 19:25.310
<b><i>Something like rice gruel...</i></b>

19:27.140 --> 19:28.270
<b><i>Shopping.</i></b>

19:29.060 --> 19:30.690
<b><i>I'm out of rice.</i></b>

19:37.150 --> 19:39.990
<b><i>Not taking the bus.
Or I'll spread my germs.</i></b>

19:40.950 --> 19:42.450
<b><i>I know. I'll go by bike.</i></b>

19:44.030 --> 19:47.120
<b><i>Good girl. You're still intelligent.</i></b>

19:48.700 --> 19:52.670
<b><i>Somehow, I've got to will myself
to get through tonight.</i></b>

20:12.190 --> 20:13.850
<b><i>I can't go by bike.</i></b>

20:14.360 --> 20:16.110
<b><i>There's no way that I can.</i></b>

20:16.520 --> 20:18.110
<b><i>So hot.</i></b>

20:18.780 --> 20:20.990
<b><i>Wait, can't I order takeout?</i></b>

20:21.490 --> 20:23.700
<b><i>Why didn't I think of that?</i></b>

20:23.700 --> 20:26.080
<b><i>Right, takeout should do.</i></b>

20:26.660 --> 20:27.910
<b><i>Smart girl!</i></b>

20:28.410 --> 20:32.000
<b><i>First, I need to put these bikes back.</i></b>

20:33.250 --> 20:36.250
<b><i>And then I'll go back to my apartment.</i></b>

20:37.840 --> 20:39.710
<b><i>Then what am I supposed to do?</i></b>

20:42.170 --> 20:43.550
<b><i>I have a headache.</i></b>

20:57.190 --> 20:58.190
<b>Akane?</b>

21:02.240 --> 21:03.280
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

21:03.780 --> 21:05.660
<b><i>I can see someone who looks like Yamada.</i></b>

21:08.120 --> 21:11.620
<b><i>But there's no way
that he'd be at my place, right?</i></b>

21:12.620 --> 21:13.620
<b>Can you hear me?</b>

21:15.830 --> 21:18.920
<b><i>A dream? Oh, come on.</i></b>

21:20.840 --> 21:23.590
<b><i>Now he's even showing up in my dreams?</i></b>

21:26.470 --> 21:27.890
<b><i>Sorry, Yamada.</i></b>

21:29.050 --> 21:31.770
<b><i>For having such a self-serving dream...</i></b>

23:06.570 --> 23:08.150
<b><i>Butterfly...</i></b>

23:08.780 --> 23:10.360
<b><i>butterfly...</i></b>

23:11.030 --> 23:13.120
<b><i>come and alight...</i></b>

23:13.280 --> 23:14.870
<b><i>on me!</i></b>

23:15.330 --> 23:17.370
<b><i>Night butterfly, Momoko Maeda.</i></b>

23:17.370 --> 23:19.580
<b><i>Tonight, for sure,
I'm going to capture the prince</i></b>

23:19.580 --> 23:20.420
<b><i>I'm meant to be—</i></b>

23:21.130 --> 23:24.090
<b>GLASSES GIRL</b>

23:21.130 --> 23:24.090
<b>COMFORTING TYPE</b>

23:24.090 --> 23:27.050
<b>NIGHT BUTTERFLY
DISASTROUS DEFEAT</b>

23:31.050 --> 23:33.260
<b>Excuse me? I'd like another.</b>

23:32.510 --> 23:35.010
<b>AKANE</b>

23:33.260 --> 23:35.010
<b>With extra gin.</b>

23:35.310 --> 23:37.470
<b>Momo's not picking up.</b>

23:38.480 --> 23:39.520
<b>Achoo!</b>
